WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.860
San Mateo, Kapitulo 2

00:02.860 --> 00:07.920
Nayanak ni Jesus itiili a Bethlehem ijehudya.

00:08.540 --> 00:10.720
Idi ni Herodes tiagdama nga ari,

00:11.160 --> 00:13.720
saan anabayag kalpasan ti panakayanak na,

00:14.180 --> 00:18.220
at damamasirib alalaki at agadaya anapan ijehudya.

00:19.020 --> 00:22.840
Sa dinot ayan, tiubing anayanak, nga ari dagdihudyo?

00:23.580 --> 00:24.620
Sinalud sudda,

00:25.340 --> 00:27.020
Nakitami tibitwin na,

00:27.020 --> 00:29.060
anag parang ijaydaya,

00:29.140 --> 00:31.560
katimay kami agdaydayaw kin kuwana.

00:32.240 --> 00:34.420
Idi madamag daytoy ni ari Herodes,

00:35.080 --> 00:37.080
na palalo ti panakariribok na,

00:37.540 --> 00:40.420
kastamu titunggal may sa ataga Hiruzalem.

00:41.080 --> 00:42.080
Pinaayapan ng ro,

00:42.220 --> 00:45.440
dagit ipangulwen apapadi kin mamaestro itilinteg,

00:46.000 --> 00:47.740
kit sinalud sudda kadakwada,

00:48.200 --> 00:50.640
no sa dinot ipakayanakan ti Kristo.

00:51.120 --> 00:52.020
Insungbat da,

00:52.740 --> 00:55.340
Itiili a Bethlehem ijehudya,

00:55.340 --> 00:57.000
ta daytoy tin surat,

00:57.020 --> 01:00.940
Sika Bethlehem iti dagati huda,

01:01.680 --> 01:04.360
saan ka amaudi kadagiti ili iti huda?

01:05.300 --> 01:07.920
Tatumaod tukin ka timay sa apangulo,

01:08.400 --> 01:10.760
amangaywan itiilik nga Israel.

01:11.400 --> 01:15.000
Inayaban nga rod ni Herodes dagiti sanga ili,

01:15.240 --> 01:17.560
kit kinasaritan na ida itinalimed,

01:18.200 --> 01:19.700
sinalud sudda kadakwada,

01:20.300 --> 01:22.420
no kaano ti panagparang tibitwen.

01:23.240 --> 01:23.940
Itikasta,

01:23.940 --> 01:25.940
imbaun na ida iji Bethlehem,

01:27.020 --> 01:28.820
at imbilin na kadakwada.

01:39.440 --> 01:42.240
Pimano dakit idi at dada itidalan,

01:42.800 --> 01:46.160
nakita damanen na ibitwen anagparang iji daya.

01:46.760 --> 01:47.860
Idimakita da,

01:48.260 --> 01:49.780
anyan naragsakda,

01:50.020 --> 01:51.580
anyan naraguda.

01:52.080 --> 01:56.880
Indaldalan na ida aginga anagsardeng itinga tuwen tibalay ayan tibing.

01:57.020 --> 02:01.720
Simrek da iti balay kit nakita dati ubing kinimariya nga ina na,

02:01.720 --> 02:05.220
nagparintumeng da anagrokbav kin kuwana.

02:05.220 --> 02:06.620
Kalpasan na,

02:06.620 --> 02:09.820
inwarda dagiti sagsago da abalitok,

02:09.820 --> 02:11.820
insenso kin mera,

02:11.820 --> 02:13.820
kit indatun da kin kuwana.

02:13.820 --> 02:16.400
Idi agawid da itiili da,

02:16.400 --> 02:19.140
sabalin adalan itinagnaan da,

02:19.140 --> 02:21.140
ta iti tagtagainap,

02:21.140 --> 02:23.140
pinakdaaran ida ti Diyos,

02:23.140 --> 02:25.940
adidan agsubli kin ni Herodes.

02:25.940 --> 02:28.940
Kalpasan ti ipapanaw dagiti mamasirib,

02:28.940 --> 02:32.440
nagparang kinihuse timaysang anghel ti apo,

02:32.440 --> 02:34.940
itimaysa at tagtagainap.

02:34.940 --> 02:35.940
Kinunana,

02:35.940 --> 02:37.940
Bumangon ka,

02:37.940 --> 02:41.940
inkaipak ni dagiti agina ijay Egypto.

02:41.940 --> 02:43.940
Agyan kayo sa jay,

02:43.940 --> 02:46.940
agingat ibagak at pumanaw kayo.

02:46.940 --> 02:48.940
Tasapulento ni Herodes ti ubing,

02:48.940 --> 02:50.940
tap'no papapatay na.

02:50.940 --> 02:52.940
Bimangon ni Jose,

02:52.940 --> 02:55.940
innala na dagiti agina kit nagropo,

02:55.940 --> 02:57.940
buwat da iti daytara bi,

02:57.940 --> 02:59.940
anapan ijay Egypto.

02:59.940 --> 03:00.940
Nagyanda sa jay,

03:00.940 --> 03:02.940
agingat ipapatay ni Herodes.

03:02.940 --> 03:04.940
Na aramid daytoy,

03:04.940 --> 03:06.940
tap'no matumpal tiinsaot ti apo,

03:06.940 --> 03:08.940
babaen iti profeta.

03:08.940 --> 03:10.940
Manipot Egypto,

03:10.940 --> 03:12.940
inayabak ti anak ko.

03:12.940 --> 03:14.940
Napalalo apungtot ni Herodes,

03:14.940 --> 03:17.940
idimadlaw na asinikapan dagiti mamasirib.

03:17.940 --> 03:19.940
Itikasta,

03:19.940 --> 03:22.940
imbilin na amapapatay aming ubing

03:22.940 --> 03:23.940
alalaki nga agtawen,

03:23.940 --> 03:26.940
itidwa winunabababa itiili a Bethlehem

03:26.940 --> 03:29.940
ken kadagiti kabangibang na.

03:29.940 --> 03:31.940
Naibatay daytoy nga aramid,

03:31.940 --> 03:33.940
itikinunadagiti sangaili

03:33.940 --> 03:36.940
maipapan itipanagparan ti bituen.

03:36.940 --> 03:39.940
Natung pangarod ti impadto ni profeta,

03:39.940 --> 03:40.940
Jeremias.

03:40.940 --> 03:42.940
Ijay Rama,

03:42.940 --> 03:44.940
nangngeg ti panagikis,

03:44.940 --> 03:47.940
dungdungaw ken nasaem asangsangit.

03:47.940 --> 03:50.940
Dungdungawan ni Raquel dagiti anak na,

03:50.940 --> 03:53.940
agsangsangit ket di na kayat ti maliuliwan,

03:53.940 --> 03:56.940
tanatay da amin apada-pada.

03:56.940 --> 03:58.940
Kalpasan anatay ni Herodes,

03:58.940 --> 04:00.940
nagparang ititagtagainip

04:00.940 --> 04:02.940
ti may sanganghel ti apo

04:02.940 --> 04:04.940
kin ni Jose ije he Egypto.

04:04.940 --> 04:06.940
Bumangon ka.

04:06.940 --> 04:08.940
Kino na ti anghel?

04:08.940 --> 04:12.940
Yahawid mon dagiti ag ina iti dagat Israel.

04:12.940 --> 04:14.940
Natayon dagiti nagpanggep

04:14.940 --> 04:17.940
amang papatay iti ubing.

04:17.940 --> 04:19.940
Bimangon nga rod ni Jose,

04:19.940 --> 04:21.940
inalana dagiti ag ina

04:21.940 --> 04:23.940
kit nagsublida ije Israel,

04:23.940 --> 04:25.940
ngim idinadamag ni Jose

04:25.940 --> 04:26.940
ani Arkilao,

04:26.940 --> 04:27.940
na anak ni Herodes

04:27.940 --> 04:29.940
na si mukhat nga ari iti Hudya,

04:29.940 --> 04:32.940
nagbuteng amapan sa Jai,

04:32.940 --> 04:34.940
babaen ititagtagainip

04:34.940 --> 04:36.940
na pakdaaran man ni Jose

04:36.940 --> 04:39.940
kat napan iti Provencia ti Galilea.

04:39.940 --> 04:42.940
Nagtaeng itiili ang maawagan iti Nazaret,

04:42.940 --> 04:44.940
itikasta na tungpal

04:44.940 --> 04:46.940
ti kinunadag iti Profeta.

04:46.940 --> 04:50.940
Maawagan to iti Nazareno.

